          "description": "3/day, an anacondaur can focus its stony gaze upon a single target within 30 feet. The target receives the Petrification status effect (Fortitude save DC 19 to negate). Blue mages may learn this ability as a 4th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 23).",
