            "familiar": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sonic Tail",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "An anacondaur will vibrate its tail sending out sonic waves around itself and those within a 20-ft. radius around himself. Anyone caught in the sonic waves takes 5d4 points of non-elemental damage and are Dazed for 1 round unless they make a Reflex save (DC 19) to take half of the damage and negate the status effect. This ability also shatters anyone who suffers from the Statue status effect unless they make a Fortitude save (DC 19). Anyone that cannot hear is immune to this effect. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 3rd level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 21).",
          "notes": {
            "familiar": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "This black anacondaur petrifies his foes and strikes them down with his two long extended claws. Watch out for his sonic tail which can daze anyone nearby him."
